   "id": "w1kbh0rfa38afp59",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120,
   "y": 2220,
   "width": 1960,
   "height": 122.5,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "GATES (pre-agreed; the anti-2am-renegotiation clause)\nG1 Aug 19: Warden + grid live w/ on-chain footprints \u00b7 activation works \u00b7 CLI + registry + prize questions ANSWERED\nG2 Aug 26: all four categories live \u00b7 replay engine producing real ranged quotes \u00b7 judge-shaped journey unbroken end-to-end\nG3 Sep 2: zero-dead-end verified by an external tester (not you) \u00b7 FREEZE Sep 5 \u00b7 SUBMIT by Sep 9\nCUT ORDER if a gate slips: 1. compare tray  2. Hawkes dashboard signal  3. vetting badges  4. third-party auto-cards\nNEVER CUT: Warden \u00b7 Showcase Mode \u00b7 replay engine \u00b7 activation caps \u00b7 the tearsheet\nSOURCES (hygiene): bnbchain.org/en/bnb-agent-studio \u00b7 docs.bnbchain.org \u00b7 studio.bnbchain.org/install \u00b7 BNB blog Jul 1 launch post",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "GATES (pre-agreed; the anti-2am-renegotiation clause)\nG1 Aug 19: Warden + grid live w/ on-chain footprints \u00b7 activation works \u00b7 CLI + registry + prize questions ANSWERED\nG2 Aug 26: all four categories live \u00b7 replay engine producing real ranged quotes \u00b7 judge-shaped journey unbroken end-to-end\nG3 Sep 2: zero-dead-end verified by an external tester (not you) \u00b7 FREEZE Sep 5 \u00b7 SUBMIT by Sep 9\nCUT ORDER if a gate slips: 1. compare tray  2. Hawkes dashboard signal  3. vetting badges  4. third-party auto-cards\nNEVER CUT: Warden \u00b7 Showcase Mode \u00b7 replay engine \u00b7 activation caps \u00b7 the tearsheet\nSOURCES (hygiene): bnbchain.org/en/bnb-agent-studio \u00b7 docs.bnbchain.org \u00b7 studio.bnbchain.org/install \u00b7 BNB blog Jul 1 launch post",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "roundness": null
